{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22371","headline":"叹老三首 二 · 白居易","name":"叹老三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有一握发，梳理何稠直。\n昔似玄云光，今如素丝色。\n匣中有旧镜，欲照先叹息。\n自从头白来，不欲明磨拭。\n鵶头与鹤颈，至老常如墨。\n独有人鬓毛，不得终身黑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}